30.2 Nothing in this Agreement excludes liability that cannot legally be excluded.

30.3 Any additional liability limitations must comply with mandatory consumer-protection and contractual laws.

31. BACKUPS AND RECOVERY

Unless separately agreed, users and operators are responsible for maintaining appropriate backups of their data.

